  "text": "QA-Restaurant-A-1791252294734\nADMIN\nQA-Restaurant-A-1791252294734\nCtrl+K\nNo open shift\nEOD Report\nReconciliation\nAssistant\nLogout\nOPERATIONS\nDashboard\nBilling / Invoices\nOrders\nLive Orders / KDS\nFloor / Tables\nReservations\nKitchen / KOT\nDIGITAL ORDERING\nQR Table Ordering\nON\nMENU & INVENTORY\nMenu & Categories\nCustomisations & Tax\nInventory & Recipes\nPurchasing & Stock Control\nPEOPLE & CASH\nCustomers CRM\nStaff & Roles (RBAC)\nPayments & Split\nOffers & Coupons\nShift & Cash Drawer\nKIOSK\nKiosk Terminals\nANALYTICS & SYSTEM\nReports & Analytics\nPrinters & Devices\nReceipt & E-Bill\nSync & Devices\nRestaurant Settings\nSubscription Plans\nAudit Trail Logs\nBackup & Restore\nHelp & Support\nInventory & Recipe Bill of Materials (BOM)\nLIVE TRACKING\n\nTrack raw stock levels, set minimum reorder thresholds, and automate ingredient deductions upon POS/Kiosk sales.\n\nCreate Recipe Formula\nAdd Stock Item\nRAW INGREDIENTS\n0 Items\nIn Warehouse Master\nSTOCK VALUATION\n₹0\n✓ Weighted Unit Cost\nLOW STOCK ALERTS\n0 Critical\nAll Stock Levels Normal\nBOM DISH FORMULAS\n0 Formulas\nAuto-Deduct on Order Sale\nRaw Warehouse Ingredients (0)\nAll Categories\nNo Raw Ingredients Recorded\n\nAdd pantry staples, dairy, produce, spices, and packaging materials to manage stock.\n\n+ Add First Ingredient\nConfigured Dish Recipe Formulas (0)\nAutomatic Ingredient Consumption\nNo Recipe Formulas Configured\n\nLink raw ingredients to menu dishes to automatically deduct inventory whenever an order is placed.\n\n+ Create Recipe Formula\nRecent Wastage Log\nLast 0 of 0 entries\n\nNo wastage logged yet. Use \"Log Wastage\" on an ingredient to record spoilage, prep trim, or breakage.\n\nJAMAN AI\nACTIVE",
